<body>
<font SIZE="2">

	<div align="center">

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="70%">
  <tr>
    <td width="14%"><p align="left">
	<img src="../../../LEIS/QUADRO/Brastra.gif"
    alt="Brastra.gif (4376 bytes)" width="74" height="82"></td>
    <td width="86%"><p align="center"><font color="#808000" face="Arial"><strong><big><big>Presidência
    da República</big></big><br>
    <big>Casa Civil<br>
    </big>Secretaria Especial para Assuntos Jurídicos</strong></font></td>
  </tr>
</table>
	</div>

<p align="center" style="margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px"><font
face="Arial" size="2" color="#000080"><strong>
<a href="http://legislacao.planalto.gov.br/legisla/legislacao.nsf/Viw_Identificacao/emc%20132-2023?OpenDocument">
<font color="#000080">EMENDA CONSTITUCIONAL Nº 132, DE 20 DE DEZEMBRO
DE 2023</font></a></strong></font></font></p>

<table border="0" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
  <tr>
    <td width="50%">
<font face="Arial" size="2"><a href="#art23">Vigência</a></font></td>
    <td width="50%">
<font face="Arial" color="#800000">
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: justify; ">
<font size="2">Altera o Sistema Tributário Nacional.</font></p>
</font></td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
<font size="2">As Mesas da Câmara dos Deputados e do Senado Federal, nos termos 
do § 3º do art. 60 da Constituição Federal, promulgam a seguinte Emenda ao texto 
constitucional:</font></p>
<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
<font size="2"><a name="art1"></a>Art. 1º A Constituição Federal passa a vigorar 
com as seguintes alterações:</font></p>
<blockquote>
	<blockquote>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">&quot;Art. 43. 
		.............................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		.....................................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art43§4">§ 4º</a> Sempre 
		que possível, a concessão dos incentivos regionais a que se refere o § 
		2º, III, considerará critérios de sustentabilidade ambiental e redução 
		das emissões de carbono.&quot; (NR)</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art50.0">&quot;Art. 50</a>. A 
		Câmara dos Deputados e o Senado Federal, ou qualquer de suas Comissões, 
		poderão convocar Ministro de Estado, quaisquer titulares de órgãos 
		diretamente subordinados à Presidência da República ou o Presidente do 
		Comitê Gestor do Imposto sobre Bens e Serviços para prestarem, 
		pessoalmente, informações sobre assunto previamente determinado, 
		importando crime de responsabilidade a ausência sem justificação 
		adequada.</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		.............................................................................................................................&quot; 
		(NR)</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">&quot;Art. 105. 
		............................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">I - 
		........................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		......................................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art105ij">j)</a> os 
		conflitos entre entes federativos, ou entre estes e o Comitê Gestor do 
		Imposto sobre Bens e Serviços, relacionados aos tributos previstos nos 
		arts. 156-A e 195, V;</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		.............................................................................................................................&quot; 
		(NR)</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">&quot;Art. 145. 
		...........................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		......................................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art145§3">§ 3º</a> O 
		Sistema Tributário Nacional deve observar os princípios da simplicidade, 
		da transparência, da justiça tributária, da cooperação e da defesa do 
		meio ambiente.</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art145§4">§ 4º</a> As 
		alterações na legislação tributária buscarão atenuar efeitos 
		regressivos.&quot; (NR)</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">&quot;Art. 146. 
		.............................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		........................................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">III - 
		.......................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		.......................................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art146-3c">c)</a> 
		adequado tratamento tributário ao ato cooperativo praticado pelas 
		sociedades cooperativas, inclusive em relação aos tributos previstos nos 
		arts. 156-A e 195, V;</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art146-3d">d)</a> 
		definição de tratamento diferenciado e favorecido para as microempresas 
		e para as empresas de pequeno porte, inclusive regimes especiais ou 
		simplificados no caso dos impostos previstos nos arts. 155, II, e 156-A, 
		das contribuições sociais previstas no art. 195, I e V, e § 12 e da 
		contribuição a que se refere o art. 239.</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art146§1">§ 1º </a>
		.....................................................................................................................</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">§ 2º É facultado ao optante pelo regime único de que 
		trata o § 1º apurar e recolher os tributos previstos nos arts. 156-A e 
		195, V, nos termos estabelecidos nesses artigos, hipótese em que as 
		parcelas a eles relativas não serão cobradas pelo regime único.</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">§ 3º Na hipótese de o recolhimento dos tributos previstos 
		nos arts. 156-A e 195, V, ser realizado por meio do regime único de que 
		trata o § 1º, enquanto perdurar a opção:</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">I - não será permitida a apropriação de créditos dos 
		tributos previstos nos arts. 156-A e 195, V, pelo contribuinte optante 
		pelo regime único; e</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">II - será permitida a apropriação de créditos dos 
		tributos previstos nos arts. 156-A e 195, V, pelo adquirente não optante 
		pelo regime único de que trata o § 1º de bens materiais ou imateriais, 
		inclusive direitos, e de serviços do optante, em montante equivalente ao 
		cobrado por meio do regime único.&quot; (NR)</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art149a.0">&quot;Art. 149-A.</a> 
		Os Municípios e o Distrito Federal poderão instituir contribuição, na 
		forma das respectivas leis, para o custeio, a expansão e a melhoria do 
		serviço de iluminação pública e de sistemas de monitoramento para 
		segurança e preservação de logradouros públicos, observado o disposto no 
		art. 150, I e III.</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">
		............................................................................................................................&quot; 
		(NR)</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art149b">&quot;Art. 149-B.</a> 
		Os tributos previstos nos arts. 156-A e 195, V, observarão as mesmas 
		regras em relação a:</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">I - fatos geradores, bases de cálculo, hipóteses de não 
		incidência e sujeitos passivos;</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">II - imunidades;</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">III - regimes específicos, diferenciados ou favorecidos 
		de tributação;</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">IV - regras de não cumulatividade e de creditamento.</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2">Parágrafo único. Os tributos de que trata o<strong class="dou-strong" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; margin-left: 4px; margin-right: 4px;"> 
		caput </strong>observarão as imunidades previstas no art. 150, VI, não 
		se aplicando a ambos os tributos o disposto no art. 195, § 7º.&quot;</font></p>
		<p class="dou-paragraph" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 500; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38px; color: rgb(22, 41, 55); font-family: rawline, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255)">
		<font size="2"><a href="../../Constituicao.htm#art149c">&quot;Art. 149-C.</a> 
		O produto da arrecadação do imposto previsto no art. 156-A e da 
		contribuição prevista no art. 195, V, incidentes sobre operações 
		contratadas pela administração pública direta, por autarquias e por 
		fundações públicas, inc
<!-- FIXTURE TRUNCADO -->
